WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<b></b>

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.250
<b><i>This is really great!</i></b>

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.000
<b>I'm just so pleased</b>

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.210
<b>that Team Ren won!</b>

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.720
<b>Though I was sweating
when his joke missed the target!</b>

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.880
<b>Like hell I missed!</b>

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.050
<b>You missed.</b>

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.510
<b>What exactly was meant
to be the funny bit?</b>

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.350
<b>What was funny? Let me tell you…</b>

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.020
<b>As usual, the company
for these little banquets</b>

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.100
<b>is really lacking.</b>

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:28.730
<b>Cool guy, aren't you? It's not like
your whole family's here cheering you on!</b>

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.610
<b>What did you say, Horohoro?</b>

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.610
<b>You guys seem to be having a good time!</b>

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.700
<b>-Hey!
-Hey!</b>

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.370
<b>Boz!</b>

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.370
<b>What the hell are you doing here?</b>

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.700
<b>We wanted to say thanks.</b>

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.960
<b>We're no longer Hao's followers,
nor are we Boz.</b>

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.630
<b>We dropped that name already.</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:49.880
<b>What?</b>

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.920
<b>I mean, after all…</b>

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.130
<b>We're really just regular monks.</b>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.290
<b>Gunma Prefecture Grass II</b>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.290
<b>Gunma Prefecture Grass II</b>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.290
<b>Ray Temple</b>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:59.290
<b>Ray Temple</b>

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.220
<b><i>We dreamed of being
the world's first Buddhist monk band,</i></b>

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.720
<b><i>laying down funky sutras
on top of the temple drum beat.</i></b>

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.230
<b><i>One day, as we were
in the middle of a long band practice,</i></b>

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:10.940
<b><i>he suddenly appeared out of nowhere.</i></b>

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.070
<b>Hao?</b>

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.690
<b>I asked him,</b>

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.070
<b>"How old are you, son?"</b>

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>"Where's your mommy?"</b>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.160
<b>You can skip the details!</b>

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.660
<b>Then, as if he could see
right through us, he said…</b>

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.210
<b>Come.</b>

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.870
<b>I'll take you with me.</b>

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.130
<b><i>And this was our response.</i></b>

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.210
<b>That didn't take long!</b>

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.800
<b>Pathetic!</b>

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.920
<b>Yes. It is pathetic.</b>

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:39.220
<b>Leaving our dream
up to someone else was a mistake.</b>

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.850
<b>But as long as we're still alive,
we can do anything.</b>

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:45.430
<b>We came to thank you
for giving us the chance to start over,</b>

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.730
<b>Mr. Chocolove</b>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.520
<b>I just did what I had to do.</b>

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.360
<b>Well, we'll get out of your hair now.</b>

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.690
<b>Wait.</b>

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:59.240
<b>You say you're ditching your name.</b>

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:01.450
<b>So what should we call you from now on?</b>

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.160
<b>We're the exciting new folk monk duo,</b>

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.440
<b>Bozu</b>

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.440
<b>Bozu</b>

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.370
<b>Bozu!</b>

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.340
<b>We'll release a CD one day,
inspired by this experience,</b>

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.750
<b>so be sure to buy it!</b>

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.550
<b>Well, see you around!</b>

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:21.430
<b>Hey! The next match will be starting soon.</b>

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.640
<b>My Oracle Bell has the match card…</b>

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:29.060
<b>Your pompadour, Ryu!</b>

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.650
<b>This can't be right!</b>

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.360
<b>Please, say it isn't so!</b>

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.150
<b><i>Lyserg…</i></b>

