00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:11.900
<b>First Tournament rules</b>

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:11.900
<b>Second Trial</b>

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:11.830
<b>All right! It's time for Match Two
of the Shaman Fight in Tokyo!</b>

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.980
<b>Ep.21</b>

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.980
<b>Ep.21</b>

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.980
<b>Iron Maiden Jeanne</b>

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:12.980
<b>Iron Maiden Jeanne</b>

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.710
<b>Let's get it on!</b>

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.330
<b>First, the mystery men in white,</b>

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.380
<b>X-I!</b>

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.510
<b>Oh, who is that?</b>

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:21.970
<b>Is that a combatant?</b>

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.890
<b>The X-Laws' top team is starting early.</b>

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.850
<b>This should be interesting.</b>

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:31.850
<b>The Iron Maiden.</b>

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:35.350
<b>Inside that is the X-Laws' boss.</b>

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.230
<b>But even more interesting</b>

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:42.490
<b>is that the boy I met eight years ago
is now a member of the X-Laws.</b>

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.950
<b>I can't wait!</b>

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.870
<b>What will Yoh do, I wonder?</b>

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.370
<b>I knew it…</b>

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.960
<b>I knew he'd left…</b>

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.130
<b>This was somewhat predictable, though.</b>

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.670
<b>What do we do, Yoh?</b>

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.340
<b>If he's made up his own mind,
there's nothing we can do.</b>

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.880
<b>It's a ten-minute walk to the stadium.</b>

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:08.090
<b>Let's Funbari-dash over and cheer him on!</b>

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:11.430
<b>So the famous X-Laws</b>

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.850
<b>are actually just a four-eyes,
a kid, and a heap of metal.</b>

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:17.100
<b>This looks more like a school play.</b>

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:20.440
<b>The magic of my native Egypt
is the best in the cosmos.</b>

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:24.280
<b>We're here to remind
the world of that fact.</b>

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:28.360
<b>The best embalmer in the cosmos,
and commander of mummies,</b>

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:29.660
<b>Khafre.</b>

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:33.160
<b>Generating infinite Furyoku
with the cosmos' greatest Pyramid Power,</b>

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.080
<b>Nakht.</b>

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.080
<b>And the supreme king
of the cosmos, I, Anatel,</b>

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:43.090
<b>command the spirits of 10,000 workers
who helped build the pyramids.</b>

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:46.470
<b>Are you quite finished?</b>

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:51.260
<b>Sorry, but whatever your reasons are
for being here, I'm not interested.</b>

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.970
<b>What did you say to me?</b>

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.180
<b>Stop it.</b>

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:57.100
<b>You're in the wrong here, Marco.</b>

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.850
<b>Insulting others is the root of evil.</b>

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:02.820
<b>Forgive me, Ms. Maiden.</b>

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:04.440
<b>Lyserg.</b>

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.860
<b>Marco seems to be all worked up.</b>

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.570
<b>I wish to see how much you've grown.</b>

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.950
<b>Would you like to start off</b>

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.160
<b>fighting all three Niles members
by yourself?</b>

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.290
<b>Me?</b>

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:19.870
<b>Bastards!</b>

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.880
<b>We'll teach you not to underestimate us!</b>

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>You think a kid like him
could take all of us on…</b>

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.920
<b>Understood.</b>

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:31.760
<b>I'm not very confident,
but if you have such high hopes,</b>

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.810
<b>I'll give it my all!</b>

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:39.230
<b>Oh, my! Lyserg is raring to go!</b>

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.940
<b>Now let's get to it!</b>

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.270
<b>Shaman Fight!</b>

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:51.450
<b>Nakht! Damn you and your little toy!</b>

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:52.410
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.080
<b>The mummy you use as
an intermediary is in that coffin, right?</b>

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.790
<b>How dare you do that to Khafre?</b>

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:06.880
<b>There's no escaping from my pendulum now.</b>

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.390
<b>Now I'm going to cut you to pieces,
just like I did to that mummy.</b>

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.140
<b>For the sake of justice.</b>

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.270
<b>Hey! You're kidding, right?</b>

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:19.980
<b>Don't do it! Please!</b>

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.110
<b>Sorry, Yoh.</b>

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:27.780
<b>Playing nice won't save anyone.</b>

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.950
<b>I won't kill you.</b>

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.280
<b>You're villains, but you're
far too insignificant for that.</b>

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.870
<b>So I just gave you a little fright.</b>

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.040
<b>But I think I've made the situation clear.</b>

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.920
<b>Admit defeat</b>

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.840
<b>and retire at once.</b>

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:47.710
<b>So this…</b>

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.760
<b>is the X-Laws…</b>

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.180
<b>Anatel!</b>

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:54.890
<b>I thought I told you to retire.</b>

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:57.890
<b>Surely, you don't want to die, right?</b>

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.730
<b>You must have families.</b>

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.940
<b>I know a little bit about the pain</b>

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.440
<b>of losing a family.</b>

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.610
<b>So do my comrades.</b>

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:12.990
<b>All of us have received pain</b>

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.450
<b>at the hands of a certain evil.</b>

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:19.700
<b>And if that evil goes unchecked,
it will claim even more victims.</b>

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:21.950
<b>Therefore,</b>

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:26.130
<b>I must progress at all costs,
including killing you.</b>

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.880
<b>Playing nice won't save anyone.</b>

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.880
<b>That's what justice means to me.</b>

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.010
<b>I don't believe it!</b>

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:39.850
<b>The Lyserg I know would never
say something so heartless!</b>

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:43.270
<b>Killing people for the sake of justice?</b>

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:45.850
<b>Where's the justice in that?</b>

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:46.810
<b>Ryu…</b>

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.440
<b>He definitely seems to have changed.</b>

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.730
<b>You took your time!</b>

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.570
<b>Where have you been?</b>

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:54.990
<b>Every-damn-where!</b>

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:57.740
<b>Ren didn't even try to Funbari-dash!</b>

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.990
<b>We had to drag him the whole way!</b>

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.500
<b>Is that the Lyserg you talked about, Yoh?</b>

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.960
<b>Yeah. We became friends in America.</b>

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.500
<b>Aren't you upset, Yoh?</b>

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:12.550
<b>Seeing your friend act this way?</b>

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.920
<b>It's fine.</b>

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:17.800
<b>He just chose the option</b>

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.220
<b>that made the most sense to him right now.</b>

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:25.230
<b>We can't pretend to understand
the sadness inside of him.</b>

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:28.810
<b>So he sought out friends who could.</b>

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.360
<b>If he feels at home with them,</b>

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:33.940
<b>I'm happy for him.</b>

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:38.070
<b>But feeling at home or not,
killing people is…</b>

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.990
<b>If he really does do something like that,</b>

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.080
<b>I will never forgive him.</b>

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.250
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.040
<b>Right or wrong,</b>

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.380
<b>people are free to make their own choices.</b>

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.510
<b>But when you kill someone,
choice goes out the window.</b>

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.510
<b>I trust my friend.</b>

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:00.640
<b>That's why I came to cheer him on.</b>

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:02.760
<b>Exactly!</b>

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:06.060
<b>Idiot. That's why you're naïve.</b>

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.980
<b>Once something's done, it's too late.</b>

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.650
<b>Foolish compassion will be your doom.</b>

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.270
<b>You think?</b>

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:14.610
<b>That's nonsense.</b>

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:15.990
<b>Right, Anna?</b>

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.280
<b>Right.</b>

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:23.160
<b>Come on! Are you going
to cry all night, Ryu?</b>

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.620
<b>If Lyserg is important to you,
then watch him!</b>

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.420
<b>Okay!</b>

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.500
<b>Good luck, cutie-pie!</b>

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.380
<b>He sure can go.</b>

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:40.130
<b>I'd expect no less from Yoh.</b>

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:41.390
<b>Lord Hao…</b>

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.560
<b>What? This is getting really good.</b>

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.020
<b>Do you want to see or something?</b>

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.220
<b>No…</b>

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:50.100
<b>It's just that I feel utterly outraged.</b>

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:53.520
<b>What? I bet it's over
something stupid again, isn't it?</b>

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:56.900
<b>No! It's not stupid at all!</b>

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.780
<b>It's that X-Laws brat!</b>

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.030
<b>Not only did he call you "evil,"</b>

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.200
<b>he basically equated you
to nothing more than a mass murderer!</b>

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.160
<b>And?</b>

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:06.790
<b>"And"?</b>

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.750
<b>He's badmouthing you when he doesn't
know the first thing about you, Lord Hao!</b>

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.750
<b>So small</b>

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.040
<b>Just leave it.</b>

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.380
<b>Facts are facts, aren't they?</b>

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:20.510
<b>As far as I'm concerned, though,</b>

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.510
<b>we're both as bad as each other.</b>

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:24.470
<b>Ms. Maiden,</b>

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:26.510
<b>it seems Niles is not making a move.</b>

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:30.180
<b>Are they really going to concede?</b>

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.270
<b>Have faith, Marco.</b>

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.310
<b>Doubt is the root of evil.</b>

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.530
<b>But just in case they do make a move…</b>

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.610
<b>Rest assured.</b>

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.360
<b>My education of Lyserg Diethel</b>

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.490
<b>was very thorough.</b>

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:48.580
<b>I don't believe it.</b>

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:55.080
<b>My royal face, completely humiliated
in front of these unwashed commoners…</b>

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:59.460
<b>I'll punish you for this!</b>

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.380
<b>Stop it, Anatel!</b>

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.630
<b>We have no way to fight back now!</b>

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.390
<b>So what?</b>

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:08.510
<b>The blood of great kings
flows through our veins!</b>

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.220
<b>We are Egyptian Shamans!</b>

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:11.640
<b>If we give up now,</b>

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.100
<b>we will never be worthy of even being</b>

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:15.560
<b>in our ancestor's presence!</b>

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.860
<b>Wings of Death!</b>

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.690
<b>We can still go on fighting!
My arms may be torn to pieces,</b>

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.860
<b>but I'll kill you with a curse instead!</b>

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.870
<b>-Wings of Death? What's that?
-You don't know the curse of the pharaohs?</b>

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:33.960
<b><i>The people who excavated the tomb
of Tutankhamen all died mysterious deaths.</i></b>

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:37.130
<b><i>Inscribed on the walls
of his tomb was this,</i></b>

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.130
<b><i>"Death shall come on swift wings</i></b>

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.720
<b><i>to whoever disturbs
the peace of the pharaoh."</i></b>

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:46.510
<b>So this is the ace up his sleeve, huh?</b>

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.180
<b>Well, this way</b>

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:51.520
<b>we'll get to see what Lyserg will do.</b>

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.100
<b>These feathers glide into your body</b>

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:57.480
<b>and destroy your windpipe!</b>

00:12:58.230 --> 00:12:59.900
<b>The Wings of Death</b>

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.530
<b>can evade even the wind
stirred up by your wire</b>

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.110
<b>like it's nothing!</b>

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.540
<b>What a shame.</b>

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:20.250
<b>You only just had your life spared.</b>

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.090
<b>Now,</b>

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.300
<b>I have no choice but to kill
the conjurer behind the spell.</b>

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.440
<b><i>The Wings of Death</i></b>

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.820
<b><i>must have got to him first!</i></b>

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:48.700
<b>Why?</b>

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:52.450
<b>Why did you stop the attack?</b>

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:54.750
<b>Morphea!</b>

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.380
<b>Why are you looking at me
with such sad eyes?</b>

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:03.250
<b>Please! Attack!</b>

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.510
<b>Or else I'll…</b>

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.260
<b>Just do it! I'm begging you!</b>

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.260
<b>It seems you're of no use to us after all,</b>

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.930
<b>Lyserg Diethel!</b>

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.520
<b>Ms. Maiden!</b>

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:22.520
<b>What are you…</b>

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.440
<b>Get out of the way.</b>

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:28.030
<b>I cannot allow anyone
with the faintest uncertainty to fight.</b>

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.870
<b>But I…</b>

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:31.780
<b>Lyserg!</b>

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:36.040
<b>If you truly wished to defeat
the enemy with all of your heart,</b>

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.910
<b>why didn't you control your Spirit Ally?</b>

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.840
<b>That you lost a battle of wills
to your Spirit Ally</b>

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.170
<b>can only mean</b>

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.130
<b>that you harbor uncertainty
deep down inside!</b>

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.680
<b>There's no room for disguising
your true intentions in the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.180
<b>I'm disappointed in you.</b>

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:59.180
<b>But if you still wish to be our comrade,</b>

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.810
<b>you can receive your punishment later.</b>

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.860
<b>Yes, sir…</b>

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:07.570
<b>Lyserg…</b>

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.110
<b>Punishment?</b>

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.780
<b>Some team you are!</b>

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:15.490
<b>Silence, villain.</b>

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.370
<b>Not only did you shun our mercy,</b>

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.630
<b>but you also said you would fatally curse
the gentle-hearted Lyserg, did you not?</b>

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:26.090
<b>And what are you going to do about it?</b>

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.710
<b>Those are big words
for some dirt lying on the ground!</b>

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.800
<b>Sinner, it seems you leave me no choice</b>

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:35.550
<b>but to judge you
and administer your penalty myself.</b>

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.440
<b>That must be a lot of Furyoku.</b>

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.070
<b>Look how much my beads are shaking.</b>

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.780
<b>Ms. Maiden! She's finally…</b>

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.200
<b>Stand me up, Marco.</b>

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:52.150
<b>Right away!</b>

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.530
<b>Count your blessings.</b>

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.830
<b>Ms. Maiden's judgment is absolute.</b>

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.330
<b>Be grateful that you</b>

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.710
<b>will be graced with the sight of her
as your penalty is administered.</b>

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.330
<b>Get a good look!</b>

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:12.840
<b>Suffering the pain of the whole world,
you are about to behold our Lord!</b>

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.680
<b>The Holy Girl,</b>

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:19.930
<b>Ms. Jeanne the Iron Maiden!</b>

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.310
<b>She's a sweet little girl!</b>

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:23.940
<b>And she's stark naked--</b>

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:25.850
<b>Surprising, isn't it?</b>

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:28.610
<b>Inside the Iron Maiden
was that little girl.</b>

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.940
<b>The boss of the X-Laws…</b>

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.820
<b>Absolutely brutal!</b>

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:33.950
<b>That's got to hurt!</b>

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:36.910
<b>Were those spikes stabbing her for real?</b>

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.330
<b>It's the only way.</b>

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.500
<b>This Iron Maiden</b>

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.330
<b>is one of Medieval Europe's</b>

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.170
<b>dreadful torture devices.</b>

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:52.630
<b>Criminals would be shut inside
the Iron Maiden</b>

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.970
<b>and impaled by her thorny embrace.</b>

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:58.430
<b>Most of her victims
would either confess out of fear</b>

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:02.180
<b>or die of shock before succumbing
to their actual injuries.</b>

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.140
<b>Many of you must be wondering</b>

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.560
<b>why I would be inside such a contraption.</b>

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.860
<b>It's a symbol of my resolution.</b>

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:14.990
<b>The world is currently cloaked
in colossal darkness.</b>

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.660
<b>Morality has been lost.</b>

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.410
<b>Wickedness runs rampant.</b>

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:22.830
<b>People commit sin upon sin
and do nothing but hurt one another.</b>

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.500
<b>I want to amend that.</b>

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.840
<b>I want the pain and the sin to be gone.</b>

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.760
<b><i>That's why I swore to our god</i></b>

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.340
<b><i>I would bear all of that with my own body.</i></b>

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:39.850
<b><i>If he would grant me
the power to save the world,</i></b>

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:42.430
<b><i>I would become an Iron Maiden myself</i></b>

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:45.430
<b><i>and carry the burden
of the people's crime and suffering.</i></b>

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:49.560
<b>So that the world may know peace!</b>

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:57.360
<b>-How wonderful! Like the Holy Mother!
-I hope she becomes the Shaman King!</b>

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.950
<b>That is why I fight.</b>

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.370
<b>To destroy the evil of this world.</b>

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.660
<b>What a load of drivel.</b>

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.130
<b>The dreams of a silly little girl</b>

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:14.130
<b>should stay in her
silly little secret diary!</b>

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:16.970
<b>Ms. Maiden!</b>

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:18.180
<b>Fear not.</b>

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.010
<b>The power attained by our Lord</b>

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:25.180
<b>can never be defiled by anyone!</b>

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.770
<b>What's happening to me?</b>

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.900
<b>I can't move an inch!</b>

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:36.190
<b>Don't tell me this
is that girl's Over Soul?</b>

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:39.150
<b>Shamash, our God of Justice.</b>

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:42.280
<b>Cast your solemn judgment</b>

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.790
<b>down on this sinful man!</b>

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.960
<b>Shamash, the sentence.</b>

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:50.920
<b>Death!</b>

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.260
<b>Anatel…</b>

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.760
<b>Most regrettable.</b>

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.550
<b>Ms. Maiden's Spirit Ally, Shamash,</b>

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.140
<b>is a God of Justice</b>

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:07.350
<b>who decreed humanity's first laws
in the Code of Hammurabi!</b>

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.850
<b>Laws exist to let people live
and protect the peace!</b>

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.310
<b>Those who break them</b>

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.650
<b>will be convicted
and punished accordingly!</b>

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:17.360
<b>The "X" in X-Laws represents "ten."</b>

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.820
<b>In other words, we are ten laws!</b>

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.490
<b><i>And we deliver justice
in accordance with the ten laws!</i></b>

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:24.950
<b><i>Right now, right here,</i></b>

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.330
<b><i>we shall realize the X-Laws' will!</i></b>

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.040
<b>Behold our Lord,</b>

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:31.210
<b>the Holy Girl,</b>

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.250
<b>Jeanne the Iron Maiden!</b>

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:40.920
<b>Her Spirit Ally's power
completely healed her wounds.</b>

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:44.510
<b>She has part of the spirit
possess her intermediary,</b>

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:46.430
<b>the Iron Maiden's mask,</b>

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:50.060
<b>while she covers her own body
with an impenetrable Over Soul…</b>

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.690
<b>Watch closely,</b>

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.940
<b>all you Patch Officiants.</b>

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.360
<b>She may well be our next Shaman King.</b>

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:01.450
<b>This is the power of a God-class Shaman!</b>

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.450
<b>You…</b>

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:08.290
<b>Your leader, Anatel, is dead.</b>

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:12.040
<b>He violated the laws of justice,
and so had to be put to death.</b>

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:14.420
<b>It's not too late to be forgiven.</b>

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.960
<b>Leave this place</b>

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.500
<b>before you become his accomplices,</b>

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.590
<b>Niles.</b>

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.590
<b>He had to be put to death?</b>

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.470
<b>For what justice?</b>

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:25.970
<b>For what crime?</b>

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.810
<b>Full Pyramid Power!</b>

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:31.810
<b>I'll turn you into a mummy
for what you've done!</b>

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.640
<b>There's such a thing…</b>

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:36.310
<b>As human emotion, you know!</b>

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:38.860
<b>Why do you continue to sin?</b>

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.030
<b>Shamash!</b>

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:47.070
<b>Over Soul! Instrument of Torture:</b>

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:48.700
<b>Interrogation Chairs!</b>

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.500
<b>Damn you!</b>

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:55.460
<b>This pain…</b>

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:58.500
<b>It's nothing compared
to the disgrace Anatel suffered!</b>

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:01.590
<b>All right. Bind them tighter,</b>

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:02.510
<b>Shamash.</b>

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:07.300
<b>I inflict pain</b>

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:09.430
<b>so you realize
both the gravity of your crimes</b>

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.470
<b>and the importance of the law</b>

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.430
<b>and repent.</b>

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.730
<b><i>Laws are rules for life itself.</i></b>

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:20.270
<b><i>They are natural
and inherent to the universe.</i></b>

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:23.990
<b><i>The pheasant chick
who doesn't heed his mother's word</i></b>

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.570
<b><i>cannot sense danger
and will be taken by the hawk.</i></b>

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.660
<b><i>The wicked bloodline of the wolf
who abandons mother and cubs</i></b>

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.870
<b><i>will end when those cubs starve to death.</i></b>

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.250
<b>In nature,</b>

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.250
<b>those who break the rules are in the wrong</b>

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.880
<b>and are doomed.</b>

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:44.210
<b>However, human society
has become complicated,</b>

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:47.760
<b>and people can no longer
entrust themselves to nature's providence.</b>

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:51.140
<b>That's why they need laws.</b>

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:55.060
<b>Absolute laws, divinely enforced.</b>

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:57.350
<b><i>In the 1700 BCE,</i></b>

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:00.060
<b><i>the human race's first laws
were handed down</i></b>

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:01.980
<b><i>by our God of Justice,</i></b>

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:03.530
<b><i>Shamash.</i></b>

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:07.030
<b>Now beg for forgiveness.</b>

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:08.700
<b>Repent.</b>

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:10.950
<b>Who the hell…</b>

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:12.530
<b>Would believe in that?</b>

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:15.870
<b>I see.</b>

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:21.500
<b>I…</b>

00:22:22.090 --> 00:22:23.210
<b>am very sad.</b>

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:27.300
<b>Over Soul!
Instrument of Torture: Guillotine!</b>

00:22:30.090 --> 00:22:33.560
<b>Over Soul!
Instrument of Torture: Statue of Apega!</b>

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:43.230
<b>Marco, Lyserg, let's go.</b>

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:45.480
<b>Victory belongs to us, X-I.</b>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:51.870
<b>That was the Holy Girl, Ms. Maiden?</b>

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:58.080
<b>-Manta!
-Manta!</b>

00:22:58.160 --> 00:23:00.620
<b>Emergency! Get a doctor, Mic!</b>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>It's hardly surprising.</b>

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:05.460
<b>He's never seen someone die before.</b>

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:07.880
<b>How could such a cute girl</b>

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:10.010
<b>do something so horrific?</b>

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:13.510
<b>They call this justice?</b>

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:15.810
<b>It was the same back in the States.</b>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:19.180
<b>They killed Boris
without batting an eyelid.</b>

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:21.350
<b>It makes sense, though.</b>

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:26.190
<b>Whoever's going to be the Shaman King
is going to have to be strong.</b>

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:27.480
<b>Ren!</b>

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:29.860
<b>She's got quite the ego,</b>

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:32.780
<b>this Iron Maiden or whatever she's called.</b>

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:35.080
<b>So arrogant.</b>

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:37.120
<b>Yoh!</b>

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:41.870
<b>It will just have to be me then.</b>

00:23:43.130 --> 00:23:44.880
<b>I'll become the Shaman King.</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.910
<b>I'll Go Anywhere with You</b>

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:50.910
<b>I'll Go Anywhere with You</b>

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:50.380
<b><i>Next episode, "I'll Go Anywhere with You."</i></b>
